 well-being.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew intends to try those activities with his pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to try those activities with his pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew currently has two dogs which is a lot to take care of (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew is searching for a perfect place for dogs. (event_time: 2023-09-06T19:49:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking for advice concerning owning a pup. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew finds that nature calms and relaxes his mind (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey asked Andrew if he has found a dog-friendly place to live. (event_time: 2023-09-06T19:49:00Z)\n  - Andrew is considering getting a dog. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey for tips on being a multi-dog pet owner (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew takes good care of his dogs. (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Andrew considers nature to be a home for his soul. (event_time: 2023-04-16T16:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew has managed to make arrangements concerning dogs despite living in the city. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew's furry friend is his companion (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Andrew agrees that pets can improve people's lives. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes Positive reinforcement can assist with dogs. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Andrew seems to consider Buddy his sidekick. (event_time: 2023-