ing","John is presenting his cousin's dog","John acknowledges that the dog's name is Ned","John has dogs","Dogs are awesome, according to John"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_1","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_1_qa_57","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What advice does Gina give to Jon about running a successful business?","golden_answer":"build relationships with customers, create a strong brand image, stay positive","hypothesis":"Gina gives Jon several pieces of advice about running a successful business, including:\n\n1. **Focus on Passion**: She advises Jon to concentrate on the reason he started his business because he loves it. (April 25, 2023)\n2. **Keep Learning and Growing**: Gina encourages Jon to continue learning and growing in his business endeavors. (May 27, 2023)\n3. **Stay Confident**: She believes that confidence is important for Jon in business and encourages him to stay confident. (April 25, 2023)\n4. **Never Give Up**: Gina encourages Jon to keep going and not to give up, emphasizing that he is close to succeeding. (April 9, 2023)\n5. **Seek Support**: She offers her full support regarding his business efforts and encourages him to keep pushing forward. (February 4, 2023, and April 25, 2023)\n\nOverall, Gina emphasizes the importance of passion, continuous learning, confidence, perseverance, and support in running a successful business.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Gina advises Jon that starting a biz is tough but suggests Jon shou