sterday. (event_time: 2023-01-31T19:03:00Z)"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_7","category":"2","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How many years passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs?","golden_answer":"three years","hypothesis":"Audrey adopted Pixie on April 2, 2023. She has owned her other three dogs (Panda, Pepper, and Precious) since March 27, 2020. \n\nTo calculate the number of years that passed between these two events:\n\n1. From March 27, 2020, to March 27, 2023, is 3 years.\n2. From March 27, 2023, to April 2, 2023, is an additional 6 days.\n\nTherefore, the total time that passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs is 3 years and 6 days.\n\nFinal Answer: 3 years and 6 days.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey has owned Panda for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has owned Pepper for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has owned Precious for 3 years. (event_time: 2020-03-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey adopted another puppy named Pixie as a surprise for Andrew. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Audrey has dogs (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Audrey's dogs are all 3 years old (event_time: 2023-07-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey has four pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey how long she has had her dogs. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Audrey shares a strong bond with her dogs. (event_time: 2023-